      "writtenOn": "2021-05-21T12:54:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Not currently. Would it make sense to do that in https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/system/core/+/1712429/1/rootdir/init.rc?\n\nI think that would work - something similar here: http://cs/android/system/core/rootdir/init.rc?l\u003d1155\u0026rcl\u003dbaa0087f0640b854b6e53ca4ea0f55dd32a97d10\n\nOTOH you could also just do it when virtmanager starts? (Or stops?)\n\n\u003e Does that get run on every boot?\nYes",
      "parentUuid": "cd1d0bcb_1be5bbc3",
      "range": {
