      "writtenOn": "2021-05-21T12:34:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "DiskFile is constructed together with the CrosvmConfig, so it can be owned by it. The bootloader/kernel/initrd come from ParcelFileDescriptors passed over Binder, to which we only get a reference.\n\nI think this is a flaw in the Rust AIDL codegen API design and ParcelFileDescriptors should be moved to the method, but that\u0027s not how it currently works unfortunately.",
